---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Advanced Features">
  <div class="docs-content">
    <h1>Advanced Features</h1>

    <h2>Components and Widgets</h2>
    <p>Enhance your slides with advanced features to boost engagement and conversions:</p>

    <hr />

    <h3>Countdown Timer</h3>
    <p>Create urgency with time-limited offers.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Set end date and time for your promotion</li>
      <li>Customize timer appearance and colors</li>
      <li>Choose format: days, hours, minutes, seconds</li>
      <li>Automatically hide banner when timer reaches zero</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="docs-tip">
      <p><strong>Pro Tip:</strong> Countdown timers can increase conversion rates by up to 30% by creating a sense of urgency for limited-time offers.</p>
    </div>

    <hr />

    <h3>Direct to Cart Button</h3>
    <p>Streamline the purchase process.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Add products directly to cart without leaving the page</li>
      <li>Customize button text and styling</li>
      <li>Select product variants</li>
      <li>Set quantity</li>
      <li>Reduce friction in the buying process</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="docs-info">
      <h4>When to Use Direct to Cart</h4>
      <p>This feature is perfect for:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Flash sales and limited-time offers</li>
        <li>Popular or trending products</li>
        <li>Impulse-buy items</li>
        <li>Simplified one-click purchases</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <hr />

    <h3>Input Form</h3>
    <p>Capture customer information or registrations.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Collect email addresses for newsletters</li>
      <li>Create signup forms for events or launches</li>
      <li>Gather customer feedback</li>
      <li>Customize form fields and validation</li>
      <li>Integrate with your email marketing platform</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="docs-note">
      <p><strong>Note:</strong> Available components depend on your slide type and subscription plan. Check your plan details for feature availability.</p>
    </div>

    <hr />

    <h2>Combining Features</h2>
    <p>For maximum impact, consider combining features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Countdown + Direct to Cart:</strong> Perfect for flash sales</li>
      <li><strong>Input Form + Product Slide:</strong> Great for early access or pre-orders</li>
      <li><strong>Video + Direct to Cart:</strong> Demonstrate products and enable instant purchase</li>
    </ul>

    <hr />

    <div class="mt-12 flex gap-4">
      <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/docs/placement`} class="btn bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-300">
        ← Previous: Banner Placement
      </a>
      <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/docs/account-management`} class="btn btn-primary">
        Next: Account Management →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
